// Walk an abandoned holt from its west door: in through the nest (a hop over the first bedding pile; the
// rest are climbed or pushed through), through the nest partition's doorway and up onto the hall table,
// where the chest stands. Checked by tests/found_places.rs too. Known layout blockers (sites.rs, not
// movement; see REFINE-movement.md): the chest is stamped inside the table top, so walking up to it never
// opens it; a 3 m bookcase stands against the garden partition's doorway, so the fungus garden and the
// east door are cut off from the hall (only the 9 m roof post can be climbed over).
map
